# Safety net for Cloudflare Workers static assets.
#
# wrangler.jsonc points the asset directory at ./friday, so nothing here
# should ever be uploaded. But if that config is missing or overridden,
# wrangler falls back to serving the repository root — which is how the
# first deploy ended up publishing .git to the internet.
#
# These patterns apply whenever the repo root IS the asset directory, and
# keep the repository plumbing out of any such deploy.
.git
.git/**
.github
.github/**
node_modules
node_modules/**
.wrangler
.wrangler/**
*.md
